s process at the airport."}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":["$","$Lf","img-0",{"src":"https://aerodynamics-bucket.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com/6c919ad62e5a060e52141057ae98534d.jpg","alt":"transavia-1.jpg","width":0,"height":0,"sizes":"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 1400px","quality":75,"className":"w-full h-auto"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":"With specially scheduled charter flights, Transavia delivered a seamless travel experience, with flexibility and service at its core. The transportation to this leading event highlights Transaviaâ€™s commitment to reliable and tailor-made solutions for business partners."}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":["$","$Lf","img-0",{"src":"https://aerodynamics-bucket.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com/0cc7da973774665379d8a8e4e139bcb7.jpg","alt":"transavia-2.jpg","width":0,"height":0,"sizes":"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 1400px","quality":75,"className":"w-full h-auto"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-4",{"children":"We are proud that Aerodynamics, together with Transavia, GI-Travel and ANVR, contributed to the success of the ANVR Congress 2024 and look forward to the next exciting destination: Rabat!"}],"\n",["$","p","p-5",{"children":["$","$Lf","img-0",{"src":"https://aerodynamics-bucket.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com/10a6069bac29fb155bf294b2508e821e.jpg","alt":"transavia-3.jpg","width":0,"height":0,"sizes":"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 1400px","quality":75,"className":"w-full h-auto"}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-12 lg:mt-16","children":["$","$L10",null,{"trigger":["$","button",null,{"className":"btn gap-0 big py-0 ps-3 pe-6 cursor-pointer","children":[["$","b",null,{"className":"button-fill bg-nachtblauw origin-left"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-full w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center relative z-10","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-nachtblauw btn-icon-bg origin-left"}],["$","strong",null,{"children":["$","span",null,{"className":"btn-icon text-white","children":[["$","em",null,{"className":"","children":["$","svg",null,{"width":"13","height":"14","viewBox":"0 0 13 14","fill":"none","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"$18","fill":"currentColor"}]}]}],"$L19"]}]}]]}],"$L1a"]}]}]}]]}]
